                 (playlistId inclus). Couverture uploadée immédiatement
                 via CoverImagePicker, rollback sur « Annuler » via
                 deleteCoverFileAction.

flow:            useState(champs) + loadDraft → useEffect saveDraft
                 débounce 500 ms → submit → run(async () => {
                   create/update ; si !ok return ;
                   assign playlist ; si !ok return ;
                   return article ;
                 }, { successMessage, onSuccess: push }).
                 handleCancel → useTransition (delete cover + push).

